    "preamble": "Kamla Shankar Prajapati vs State Of U.P. And Another on 7 February, 2024 High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc:21650 Court No. - 93 Case :- Application U/S 482 No. - 2885 of 2024 Applicant :- Kamla Shankar Prajapati Opposite Party :- State of U.P. and Another Counsel for Applicant :- Krishna Mani Counsel for Opposite Party :- G.A. Hon'ble Arun Kumar Singh Deshwal,J. 1. Heard learned counsel for the applicant and Sri Brijesh Kumar Dwivedi, learned A.G.A. for the State. 2. The present application under Section 482 Cr.P.C. has been filed for quashing of the order of Non-Bailable Warrant dated 10.3.2010 in Complaint Case No.4838 of 2006 (State vs. Kamla Shankar Prajapati) under Section 7/16 of Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954, Police Station Manda, District Prayagraj, pending in the Court of Additional Chief Judicial Magistrate IInd, Allahabad. 3.",
